<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tit</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc1">TITO</para>
  <para style="mt4">ƆFA MANE</para>
  <para style="mt1">TITO</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul hworɔle krataa he kɔyɛ afoɛ 61-64 Y.A<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> wɔ Makedonia, yeti ebia mmerɛ bɔ bɛli moa bɛyele ye bɛfili prizin wɔ Roman ne, ɛberɛ nekaa bie yeɛ ɔhworɔle krataa ne ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bɔ yeti yeɛ Paul hworɔle krataa ne yeɛ ole kyɛ, né ɔpena kyɛ Tito nwu bɔ odikyɛ ɔyɛ ɔ; osa maa onwuni ye kyɛ, ɔhaw ahoroɛ bɔ odi ye nwo dwumaa wɔ asafo nanu ne, ɔta ye si.—<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 1:5">Tit 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:15">2:15</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Né Tito adwuma ne yɛ se paa, ofikyɛ:</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Né nningyein biemɔ kɔhora kɔmaa asafo nanu kɔkyekyɛ. Né ebiemɔ ate atua, na né basɔ toa pɛlɛ nu twann. Bɛha bɛhyirele ebiemɔ po kyɛ, sɛ bambɛ bɛ toa a, bɛngonya ngoa. Ne besa bɛhyɛ Yudafoɛ anansesɛm nwo nguraen, na ne bɛsɛkye aliemaa nemɔ gyidie. Né odikyɛ Tito dwudwo kyire sɔ mmenia nemɔ.</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Né Kretafoɛ bɔ baayɛ Kristofoɛ nemɔ bie suban ttemaye, sɔ suban nanu yeɛ bɛtetele bɛ ɔ. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 1:12">Tit 1:12</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 3:2">3:2</ref></char>) Yeti, né ebiemɔ da sɔ suban ne bie ali. Ɛhene ati né odikyɛ Tito maa bɛnwu bɔ odikyɛ Kristoniɛ biala yɛ, ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ ɔte akwalaa anaa panyi, brienzua anaa brasua, akoaa anaa dehyeɛ ne. Né odikyɛ ɔyɛ nneasoɛ ma bɛ, na ɔka nahorɛ wɔ ye ngyerɛkyerɛ nu.—<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 2:1-12">Tit 2:1-12</ref></char>.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yeti, Paul fa wurale Tito sa kyɛ, oli ɔhaw ahoroɛ bɔ ɔkɔ so wɔ asafo nanu nanwo dwumaa, na ɔye mmrienzua bɛ bɛfata ma bɛyɛ asafo nu mbanyi.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Adwuma bɔ ne Tito yɛ ye wɔ Kreta nanwo akwankyerɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 1:5-16">1:5-16</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyerɛkyerɛ bɔ ɔte krongron; suban bɔ odikyɛ Kristoniɛ da ye ali (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 2:1-3:11">2:1–3:11</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Akwankyerɛ bɔ ɔfa mane Tito ne ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="TIT 3:12-15">3:12-15</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1" />Me Paul, bɔ ɔnate bɛ bɔ Nyameɛ aye bɛ ne gyidie, ɔne nahorɛ nanwo nimdeɛ bɔ odi mu bɔ ɔne nyamesom pa yia nati, nde Nyameɛ akoaa ne Yesu Kristo somafoɛ. <verse eid="TIT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2" />Sɔ gyidie ne nahorɛ namukoraati gyi daa ngoa nwo anidasoɛ naso, sɔ anidasoɛ ne, Nyameɛ bɔ ɔngora mbɛ anoanu ne yeɛ wafa wahyɛ yɛ bɔ fi teteete. <verse eid="TIT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />Ye mmerɛ bɔ ɔsɛ nu ne, ɔnate asɛnka adwuma bɔ y'Agyenkwa Nyameɛ maa bɛfa bɛmane me naso lale ye dwirɛ ne ali.<verse eid="TIT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />Mefa krataa he mekɔma Tito bɔ wayɛ kyɛ mma bɔ mene ye wɔ gyidie kõ nu ne:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:4">Adom ne asomdwie bɔ ofi yɛ Baba Nyameɛ ne Yesu Kristo bɔ ɔte y'Agyenkwa ne berɛ ha wɔ.<verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />Nyakyile wɔ wɔ Kreta, kyɛ ɛnea toto nningyein bɔ ɔngɔ yé ne, na ɛye mbanyi wɔ kuro biala nu kyɛbɔ ngyirele wɔ ne; <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" />sɛ ebie kɔhora kɔɔyɛ panyi a, odikyɛ ɔyɛ ebie bɔ edwirɛ nne ye nwo, sɛ wagya a ɔye kõ, ye mmaa te gyidifoɛ bɔ ebiala se kyɛ bɛnyɛ basabasa anaa asoserɛ. <verse eid="TIT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />Ɔnate kyɛ ɔnea Nyameɛ awuro so nati, odikyɛ ɔyɛ ebie bɔ edwirɛ nne ye nwo, onni ye ahone so dwirɛ, ɔmvɛ yaa ndɛ, ɔtte kɔwenzaniɛ, onguro ngondii, na ye nye mmoro sikaa. <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />Mmom ye nye gye ye nwo kyɛ okole ɛwɔfoɛ, ye nye gye ye nwo kyɛ ɔkɔyɛ nikye pa, y'adwene nu la berɛ, ɔtengyɛ, odi nahorɛ, ɔkora hyɛ ye nwo so, <verse eid="TIT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />sɛ́ ɔkyirekyire a, ɔfa ye ngyerɛkyerɛ ne gyina nahorɛ dwirɛ naso, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɔkɔhora kɔfa ngyerɛkyerɛ pa ne kɔhyɛ afoforɛ nguraen, ná wadwudwo wahyire bɛ bɔ bedwudwo betia ne.<verse eid="TIT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Ofikyɛ mmeni pee ate atua, bɛkeka edwirɛ bɔ mvasoɛ biala nne so, bɛlaka-laka mmenia, ɛnga-nga bɛ bɔ balɛ́ bagyina nu kyɛ, odikyɛ brienzua biala pɛ ye toa ne. <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />Odikyɛ bɛmaa sɔ mmenia nemɔ mua bɛ noa, ofikyɛ mvasoɛ tɛɛ bɔ bɛpena nati nningyein bɔ ɔnzɛ kyɛ bekyirekyire ne, ɛhene yeɛ bekyirekyire bɛfa bɛsɛkye gyidie bɔ abusua ne le ye ne ɔ. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Kretaniɛ bie bɔ ɔte diifoɛ po hane kyɛ: “Kretafoɛ de, daa bɛpɛ anoanu, bɛte ngaka bɔ bɛ nwo yɛ suro, akwadwofoɛ bɔ bɛdi ngwasea adidie.”<verse eid="TIT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Sɔ dwirɛ he te nahorɛ, yeti dwudwo kyire bɛ paa, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɛkɔyɛ se wɔ gyidie nanu, <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />ná bandie Yudafoɛ anansesɛm, ɔne mmenia bɔ bahwe bɛ nwo bafi nahorɛ nanwo ne ahyɛdeɛ ne. <verse eid="TIT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Bɛ bɔ bɛ nwo te ne, nikye biala nwo te ma bɛ; nakoso bɛ bɔ bɛ nwo nde na bɛlle gyidie ne de, nikye fee nwo nde mma bɛ. <verse eid="TIT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />Bɛnwa bɛse Nyameɛ, nakoso bɛfa bɛ nneyɛɛ bɛkyire kyɛ bapo ye. Bɛyɛ akyiwadeɛ, bemmu nikye, na ɛfa bɛ yɛ nikye pa biala a, ɔnyɛ yé.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Nakoso wɔ de, ka edwirɛ bɔ ɔne ngyerɛkyerɛ pa ne yia. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />Mmrienzua bɔ bɛ nye afi ne, bɛyɛ nikye bie a bɛnea yé, bɛma bɛ nye la ase, bɛhyɛ bɛ nwo so, bɛyɛ mmenia bɔ bɛyɛ se wɔ gyidie ne ɔdɔ nu, na bemia bɛ nye begyina amaneɛ nu. <verse eid="TIT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Mmrasua bɔ bɛ nye afi ne koso, bɛbɔ bra pa; nnɛmaa bɛsɛkye mmenia dumaa, nnɛmaa bɛyɛ akɔwenzafoɛ, mmom behyire nikye pa. <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />Kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɛkɔtu ndaluwa fo maa bɛkɔlɔ bɛ humɔ ne bɛ mmaa mɔ, <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />bɛkɔmaa b'adwene nu kɔla berɛ, bɛkɔbɔ bra bɔ ye nwo te, bɛkɔyɛ awuro adwuma, bɛkɔyɛ pa, bɛkɔbrɛ bɛ nwo ase bɛkɔma bɛ humɔ, ná mmenia anga edwirɛ tɛɛ biala amva Nyameɛ dwirɛ nanwo.<verse eid="TIT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Mmrandeɛ koso, tu bɛ fo kyɛ bɛhyɛ bɛ nwo so. <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />Nikye biala nu ne, yɛ nikye pa maa bɛsuesua. Sɛ ekyirekyire a, ka nahorɛ, nnɛfa wɔ ngyerɛkyerɛ di angorɛ, <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />ka edwirɛ bɔ ye nwo te, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɛ bɔ bɛdwɔso betia yɛ ne nyunu kogua ase, ofikyɛ bɛngonya edwirɛ tɛɛ biala bɛngɔha bɛngɔfa yɛ nwo. <verse eid="TIT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />Odikyɛ ngoaa brɛ bɛ nwo ase ma bɛ wuramɔ wɔ nikye biala nu, bɛyɛ nikye bɔ ɔkɔmaa bɛ wuramɔ nye kɔgye bɛ nwo, nnɛmaa bɛyɛ nyenyewa, <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />nnɛmaa bɛwia bɛ, mmom bɛma benya bɛ nu gyidie, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a anuonyam kɔwa y'Agyenkwa Nyameɛ ngyerɛkyerɛ nanwo wɔ nikye biala nu.<verse eid="TIT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ adom bɔ ɔkɔmaa sona biala konya ngoa ne, bala ye ali. <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />Ɔtete yɛ maa yɛkyi bɔne ne wiase akɔnnɔ, na yɛfa adwene bɔ enu la berɛ, tenenee ne nyamesom pa yɛtena ase wɔ wiase he anu, <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />mmerɛ bɔ yɛnwondɛ kyɛ anidasoɛ bɔ ɔyɛ anigye ne kɔwa nu, na yɛnwondɛ mmerɛ bɔ Nyameɛ piri ne y'Agyenkwa Yesu Kristo kɔye bɛ nwo ali wɔ anuonyam nu ne. <verse eid="TIT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" />Kristo yeɛ ɔfale ye nwo bɔle afɔleɛ mane yɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a okole yɛ kofi yɛ amumuyɛɛ mukoraati nu, na wate mmenia biemɔ nwo wafa bɛ wayɛ ye bɔbɔ ye agyapadeɛ; bɛ bɔ bɛ nye gye ye nwo kyɛ bɛkɔyɛ nningyein pa ne.<verse eid="TIT 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />Tumi bɔ bafa bama wɔ ne, fa ka ɛhemɔ nwo dwirɛ, na tu bɛ fo. Nnɛmaa ebiala bu wɔ animtia.<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />Kɔ so kaye bɛ kyɛ bɛyɛ sotie na bɛbrɛ bɛ nwo ase bɛma awaen ne bɛ bɔ bɛle tumi ne, ná besiesie bɛ nwo bɛma adwuma pa biala. <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" />Nnɛmaa bɛka ebiala nwo dwirɛ tɛɛ, nnɛmaa bɛne ebiala kõ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nnɛmaa bɛne ebiala bɔ bɛ nwo alapaa” </char></note> mmom bɛyɛ mmenia bɔ bɛdwo, na bɛbrɛ bɛ nwo ase bɛma ebiala. <verse eid="TIT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Ofikyɛ yɛ koso, mmerɛ bie bɔ wapɛ nu ne, né yɛnze nworɛ, yɛmmu nikye, né yamini, yɛyɛle ngoaa yɛmane akɔnnɔ ahoroɛ, né yɛ nye boro nikye, yɛyɛle nningyein bɔ ɔttemaye, na né yɛtane-tane yɛ nwo.<verse eid="TIT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />Nakoso mmerɛ bɔ y'Agyenkwa Nyameɛ yele ye anwunvoin ne ye dɔ ali hyirele mmenia ne, <verse eid="TIT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />ɔlɛle yɛ ngoa; nná yɛ tenenee ti ɔ, mmom ye anwunvoin ti ɔnate ye honhom krongron naso biale yɛ maa yɛyɛle foforɛ. <verse eid="TIT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />Sɔ honhom he yeɛ ɔnate y'Agyenkwa Yesu Kristo so hwie guale yɛ so maa obuli so ne. <verse eid="TIT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />Na sɛ ɔnate Ye adom so bu yɛ bem a yayɛ nnehyeɛ, kyɛbɔ daa ngoa nwo anidasoɛ bɔ yele ye ne te ne. <verse eid="TIT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Sɔ dwirɛ he te nahorɛ. Ná mepena kyɛ ɛkɔso ka sɔ dwirɛ ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛ bɔ banya gyidie wɔ Nyameɛ nu ne kɔhɔ so kɔfa b'adwene kosie nningyein pa bɔ odikyɛ bɛyɛ naso. Sɔ nningyein he te pa, na mvasoɛ wɔ so ma sona biala.<verse eid="TIT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />Nakoso twe wɔ nwo fi aporowaa bɔ nyanza biala nne nu, abusua sanden nwo dwirɛ, manzoin, ne mmeraa nwo ngondii nwo, ofikyɛ mvasoɛ biala nne so, na ɔmmoka. <verse eid="TIT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Na sona bɔ ɔfa mbakye-mbakye-muɛ ba ne, sɛ edwudwo kyire ye kõ anaa nyɔ a, twe wɔ nwo fi ye nwo. <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />Na nwu ye kyɛ sona bɔ ɔte sɔ ne, wamini, wayɛ ye adwene kyɛ ɔkɔyɛ bɔne, na ye bɔbɔ obu ye nwo fɔ.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />Menya mesoma Artema anaa Tikiko meba wɔ berɛ a, bɔ wɔ nwo mmɔden kyɛ ɛkɔwa me berɛ wɔ Nikopoli, ofikyɛ ayirɛ bɔ ɔba ne, ɛberɛ yeɛ mepena kyɛ metena ɔ. <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" />Bɔ mmɔden kyɛ ɛkɔmaa Apolo ne Zena bɔ ɔte lɔya<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɔ ɔse mmeraa paa ne.”</char></note> ne sa kɔha bɔ behia biala, na bɛ nwo angyere bɛ wɔ b'akwanduo nanu. <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />Ná ma yɛ mmenia nemɔ nwu ye kyɛ, odikyɛ bɛkɔ so bɛyɛ adwuma pa kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛkɔhora bɛkɔboka bɛ bɔ bɛ nwo ahyere bɛ paa ne, nná bannyɛ foen.<verse eid="TIT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ me nwo wa ne nwa bɛkyea wɔ. Kyea bɛ bɔ bɛdɔ yɛ wɔ gyidie nu ne ma yɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:15">Adom ha ɛmɔ mukoraati.<verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>